sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cron as cron or engineer
    participant Sync as run_sync.sh / sync.py
    participant BR as Baserow API
    participant SD as StrictDoc
    participant Git as GitHub
    participant Rev as Reviewer

    Cron->>Sync: start (scheduled 06:15 or manual)
    Sync->>Git: git pull main
    Sync->>BR: sync.py baseline: read Requirement rows
    Note over Sync,BR: Approved and already on main = merged
    Sync->>BR: PATCH Status = Baselined
    Sync->>BR: sync.py export: GET needs, requirements, elements, allocations, verifications
    BR-->>Sync: rows (database token)
    Sync->>Sync: check duplicate IDs, broken links, requirements with no need, removed or reused IDs
    alt any error
        Sync-->>Cron: exit 2, nothing written
    else all checks pass
        Sync->>Sync: write docs/sdoc/*.sdoc
        Sync->>SD: strictdoc export (must parse)
        Sync->>Git: push branch sync/timestamp, open Pull Request
        Rev->>Git: review and merge Pull Request (baseline)
        Note over Git,BR: next run marks the merged requirements Baselined in Baserow
    end
